### ============================================================
###  ADMIN API — Online Learning Platform
###  Base URL : http://localhost:1935/admin-api
###  Auth     : Bearer token — login as ADMIN first via POST /auth/login
###             then set: Authorization: Bearer <token>
### ============================================================

### ── USERS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [1] Get All Active Users
###     Returns every user where isUserActive === true (password excluded).
GET http://localhost:1935/admin-api/users
Authorization: Bearer <token>

###

### [2] Deactivate a User (soft disable — sets isUserActive to false)
###     The user can no longer log in. Record is preserved in the database.
PATCH http://localhost:1935/admin-api/users/deactivate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <token>

{
    "userId": "683f1a2b4c5d6e7f8a9b0c1d",
    "isUserActive": false
}

###

### [3] Activate a User (re-enable — sets isUserActive back to true)
PATCH http://localhost:1935/admin-api/users/activate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <token>

{
    "userId": "683f1a2b4c5d6e7f8a9b0c1d",
    "isUserActive": true
}

###

### [4] Soft-Delete a User via URL param
###     Immediately sets isUserActive to false.
###     Useful for one-click disable from an admin dashboard table.
DELETE http://localhost:1935/admin-api/users/683f1a2b4c5d6e7f8a9b0c1d
Authorization: Bearer <token>

###

### ── COURSES ───────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [5] Get ALL Courses (active AND inactive)
###     Admin sees every course regardless of isCourseActive status.
GET http://localhost:1935/admin-api/courses
Authorization: Bearer <token>

###

### [6] Deactivate a Course (hide from students)
###     Sets isCourseActive to false.
PATCH http://localhost:1935/admin-api/courses/deactivate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <token>

{
    "courseId": "684a2c3d5e6f7a8b9c0d1e2f"
}

###

### [7] Activate a Course (make visible again)
###     Sets isCourseActive back to true.
PATCH http://localhost:1935/admin-api/courses/activate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <token>

{
    "courseId": "684a2c3d5e6f7a8b9c0d1e2f"
}

###

### ── ANALYTICS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [8] Get Platform Enrollment Analytics
###     Returns:
###       • courseEnrollmentCounts — per-course enrollment, completion,
###                                  in-progress counts (sorted by enrolments)
###       • leaderboard           — top 10 students by completed courses
###       • totalEnrollments      — platform-wide count (excl. Dropped)
###       • completedEnrollments  — count of Completed enrollments
GET http://localhost:1935/admin-api/analytics
Authorization: Bearer <token>
